{"schemaVersion":1,"skill":{"id":"alirezarezvani--claude-skills--zero-hallucination-coder","name":"zero-hallucination-coder","description":"Runs a disciplined Discuss -> Map -> Decompose -> Execute -> Verify loop that grounds code in verified structure — no invented APIs, no assumed imports, no placeholder code — with a lazy-senior-dev YAGNI ladder that deletes unnecessary code before it is written. Use when a coding task is high-stakes, complex, or spans existing code (auth, databases, migrations, multi-file features), or when the user explicitly asks to plan carefully before coding, avoid hallucinated code, or work rigorously. Not for trivial edits, typos, or throwaway one-off scripts — those do not need the full loop.","category":"Development","tags":["zero","hallucination","coder","runs","disciplined","discuss","map","decompose","execute","verify","loop","grounds","code","verified","structure","no","invented","apis"],"repo":"alirezarezvani/claude-skills","owner":"alirezarezvani","stars":26382,"official":false,"featured":false,"license":"MIT","licensePath":"LICENSE","revision":"19392f7a08264ed00486a251f5b2098321771f94","path":"engineering/zero-hallucination-coder/skills/zero-hallucination-coder","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/alirezarezvani/claude-skills/tree/19392f7a08264ed00486a251f5b2098321771f94/engineering/zero-hallucination-coder/skills/zero-hallucination-coder","checkedAt":"2026-09-24T09:18:44.317Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-26T13:53:02Z","fileCount":2,"bytes":14993,"sha256":"9f49f791530fc5970db5c8be924f50e0ecc7af4600a08689f81ad4a3cb58bdb1","historical":false},"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","sourcePath":"engineering/zero-hallucination-coder/skills/zero-hallucination-coder/SKILL.md","bytes":13921,"sha256":"9f49f791530fc5970db5c8be924f50e0ecc7af4600a08689f81ad4a3cb58bdb1","mode":420,"url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/alirezarezvani/claude-skills/19392f7a08264ed00486a251f5b2098321771f94/engineering/zero-hallucination-coder/skills/zero-hallucination-coder/SKILL